### 创建 Data Kiosk 查询任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/data-kiosk/queries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":"query { sampleQuery { sales { date } } }"}

### 查询 Data Kiosk 任务列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/data-kiosk/queries/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","processingStatuses":["DONE"],"pageSize":20}

### 查询 Data Kiosk 任务详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/data-kiosk/queries/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","queryId":"QueryId1"}

### 取消 Data Kiosk 查询任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/data-kiosk/queries/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","queryId":"QueryId1"}

### 查询 Data Kiosk 文档下载信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/data-kiosk/documents/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","documentId":"DocumentId1"}
